  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Work hard, play hard, and rest even harder! Lace up the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 to rise, shine, and power through your active routine in style. Featuring snappy and responsive Zoom Air cushioning, these silhouettes provide a quick-off-the-ground sensation as you head out and about. From relaxing on the couch to crushing it at the gym, these sneakers make it easy for you to go with the flow and swing into action mode.</p> <p>Accented with metal tones, monochromatic neutrals, and a metallic Swoosh, these silhouettes let you stay on top of your style game. Wherever you want to go, whatever you want to do, these sneakers come with a grippy rubber outsole that keeps you ready for anything and everything. Making good times better and hard times easier, the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 is all set to earn the top spot in your sneaker collection.</p> <p><strong>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Real and synthetic leather upper provides long-lasting durability.</li> <li>Mesh panels and ventilation ports on the heel deliver maximum breathability.</li> <li>Plastic caging on the side ensures excellent support.</li> <li>Foam midsole offers cushioning and responsiveness.</li> </ul> <p>*Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p><hr /><p>Long days on your feet call for comfort that keeps up and a look that works with almost anything. The Nike Zoom Vomero 5 blends cushioned support, breathable layering, and a sleek running-inspired design, making it an easy choice for everyday wear, travel, commuting, and casual gym sessions.</p><ul><li>Real and synthetic leather upper adds durability and structure</li><li>Mesh panels and heel ventilation ports help keep airflow moving</li><li>Plastic side caging provides supportive containment</li><li>Foam midsole and Zoom Air cushioning deliver a soft, responsive ride</li><li>Rubber outsole adds durable traction for daily wear</li></ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say the fit feels true to size with a comfortable, secure feel. For the best fit, we recommend starting with your usual size; if you prefer extra toe room or wear thicker socks, some shoppers found a half size up works well, while others liked the slightly roomier feel of their regular size.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for everyday wear, long walks, commuting, travel, and long hours on your feet when comfort and style matter equally.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p><p>The layered upper, sculpted midsole, and heritage running lines give this pair a standout look that still feels easy to wear day after day. Reviewers love how easily it dresses up or down and pairs with everything from workout sets to everyday outfits.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say the comfort shows up right away with little to no break-in needed. Some note it feels even better after a few wears, making it a strong option for regular rotation.</p> <p><strong>Care & Maintenance</strong></p><p>To keep the mixed-material upper looking its best, spot clean gently and let it air dry. Regular light cleaning can help preserve the finish and keep the shoe looking fresh for everyday wear.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Pink Rise/Bleached Lilac</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>FJ2028-603</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 2.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 35.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 3</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 36</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'